      ],
      "source": "https://henderson.nc.gov/community/history.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Henderson’s downtown includes the Central Business Historic District, a National Register site featuring 19th‑century brick buildings.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henderson%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "For generations, tobacco, cotton, and textile mills powered Henderson’s economy, though retail has become a recent growth sector.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
